\\begin{matrix}\n\t\t1 & -2  \\\\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t\\end{matrix}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059577 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}y+x-5-3z=0 \\\\ z=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z=1-2x\\end{cases}\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059577 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z &=0 \\\\ z &=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z &=1-2x\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059577 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}x+y-3z=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z=-2\\end{cases}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\begin{matrix}\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3  \\\\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1  \\\\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t\\end{matrix}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059577 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z &=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z &=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\begin{matrix}\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3  \\\\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1  \\\\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t\\end{matrix}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059578 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{cases}\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059578 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-4y &=-12 \\\\ 3x+y &=1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059579 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{cases}\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059579 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{2} &=a \\\\ 5+3b-a &=4c \\\\ d &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059579 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{cases}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059579 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d &=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d &=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059969 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\begin{cases}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{cases}$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 false] [17592186059969 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z &=4 \\\\ x+z &=9\\end{aligned}\\right.$$" 13194139535650 17592186045443 true] [17592186059969 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\\begin{cases}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{cases}$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\